@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api

### A API está viva?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login certo (deve devolver o accessToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Senha errada (deve dar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "senhaerrada"
}

### E-mail inválido (deve dar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "isso-nao-e-email",
  "password": "admin12345"
}
